{
    "id": 155,
    "title": "Headings sweep: Merriweather on every heading",
    "why": "Jason chose \"headings everywhere now\" (2026-11-18, Release 3a). 3a's one setting moved only Tailwind's font-serif headings; most headings set their font in their page's own styles (ui-serif,Georgia,serif, Georgia,serif, Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif), so on the live FAQ 14 of 15 headings were still the device's serif. This replaces each of those stacks, where it follows font: or font-family:, with var(--tv-font-head,<the same stack>): 288 places in 141 files. Font only: undoing the replacement gives back every live file exactly. Left as they are: emails (Mailer.php; mail apps can't read var()), the order packet document (MarketCheckout.php), and storefront themes' own fonts (var(--tvb-hf,…)). FAQ: the fonts answer updated.",
